*.app/
# Sparkle keeps Updater.app inside its framework and seals it into the framework's
# signature; *.app/ would silently drop it, leaving every release with a broken Sparkle
# that cannot launch its installer.
!Vendor/Sparkle.xcframework/**/Updater.app/
